# Cueva Secreta, floor 1 (C9, contract 56), 30 x 24, a cave: the POST-GAME dungeon, open only when the hero is the champion (flag league_champion: Ciudad Marea's harbour guard in front of the hatch hides then). The entrance
# (13..14, 23) arrives from Ciudad Marea; the halls branch round to the ladder up (24,4). Look: the approved CUEVA scene (tools/c9_mock.py): LIGHT rock with tiny crystal glints, bright crystal clusters, stalagmites; the floor is the
# encounter ground (the strongest wild creatures of the game, L46 - 56 on this floor).
@map cueva_secreta_1
@size 30 24
@interior no
@cave yes
@area cueva_secreta
@bg 0
@fill crysg
@spawn south 13 22 N
@spawn from_2 24 5 S
@encounters grass rate=12
  cragodile 46 50 15
  tuskumo 50 54 5
  dashmark 48 52 10
  echowing 48 52 15
  bouldrum 48 52 10
  pinekeeper 50 54 10
  teslarch 48 52 10
  anklord 52 56 5
  veilmoth 48 52 15
  clubtail 46 50 5
  foldling 48 52 5
@end
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 2 creatures of this table wander the whole walkable floor (grass included); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 2 table=grass area=,. period=1800
@legend
  .  tile=crysg
  ,  tile=crys_0
  W  tile=none object=swall
  r  tile=none object=mrubble
  _  tile=none
  c  tile=crysg object=gcry
  a  tile=crysg object=stalag_s
  n  tile=crys_0
  L  tile=crys_0 door=rope_ladder
  U  tile=crys_0 door=rope_ladder
  i  item=ultra_cristal
  j  item=prime_salve
  k  item=vit_hp
  l  item=vit_atk
  m  item=vit_def
  o  item=vit_spd
  p  item=vit_spc
  b  tile=crysg item=life_blaze
  H  tile=crysg hidden=life_blaze   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
